%U A399186 90032424330793132,2940987569497563760,102107973073610020346,3754960703284958922530,145811866551818771301182
%N A399186 Number of square (0,1)-matrices with n ones, no zero rows or columns, and the same multiset of row sums as of column sums.
%F A399186 a(n) = Sum_{lambda partition of n} N(lambda)*(k!/Product_{j=1..k} m_j!)^2, where k is the number of parts of lambda, m_j is the multiplicity of j in lambda, and N(lambda) is the number of k X k (0,1)-matrices whose row-sum vector and column-sum vector are both lambda (in nonincreasing order).
%e A399186 a(3) = 10: 6 permutation matrices of order 3,and the 4 matrices [0,1;1,1],[1,0;1,1],[1,1;0,1],[1,1;1,0] of order 2.
%Y A399186 Cf. A321733 (row-sum vector equal to column-sum vector), A321735 (weakly decreasing row and column sums), A321739 (unlabeled version, up to independent permutations of rows and columns).
%K A399186 nonn,new
%O A399186 0,3
